---
import Brand from "../../components/Brand.astro";
import Legal from "../../layouts/Legal.astro";
import { config } from "../../config";
---
<Legal title="Returns & cancellation" description="Your 14-day right to cancel a ola order and how returns work (DRAFT, needs legal review).">
  <h2>Your 14-day right to cancel</h2>
  <p>
    Under UK and EU distance-selling rules you can cancel your order within 14 days after the day you receive the watch,
    without giving any reason. If you cancel before it is delivered, you can simply refuse delivery or tell us.
  </p>

  <h2>How to cancel</h2>
  <p>
    Tell us clearly before the 14 days end, by email to
    <a href={`mailto:${config.supportEmail}`}>{config.supportEmail}</a> with your order number. You may use the model
    cancellation form below, but you don't have to.
  </p>

  <h2>Returning the watch</h2>
  <p>
    Send the watch back to us within 14 days after telling us you are cancelling. We will email you the return address.
    {config.freeReturns
      ? " Returns are free: we send you a prepaid return label."
      : " Unless the watch is faulty or not as described, you pay the direct cost of returning it."}
    {/* TODO(owner): return address / process. */}
  </p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>
    We refund the price of the watch and the standard delivery cost within 14 days after we receive the watch back (or
    you provide proof that you sent it, whichever is earlier), using the same payment method. We may reduce the refund if
    the watch has been handled more than was needed to check what it is and how it works.
  </p>

  <h2><Brand name="care" /></h2>
  <p>
    Cancelling the watch order also cancels your <Brand name="care" /> subscription. You can cancel <Brand name="care" /> on its own at
    any time from your account — see the <a href="/legal/subscription-terms/">subscription terms</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Faulty watch</h2>
  <p>Your legal rights for faulty goods are explained in <a href="/legal/warranty/">guarantee &amp; warranty</a>.</p>

  <h2>Model cancellation form</h2>
  <p>
    To {config.companyName}, {config.address}, {config.supportEmail}:<br />
    I hereby give notice that I cancel my contract of sale of the following goods: ____<br />
    Ordered on / received on: ____<br />
    Name: ____ · Address: ____<br />
    Signature (only if on paper): ____ · Date: ____
  </p>
</Legal>
